<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa Transnet director suspended on full pay.</title>
<headline>S.Africa Transnet director suspended on full pay.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African transport parastatal Transnet said on Friday it had suspended executive director Joe Mabayo Ndhlela pending the completion of an investigation into allegations of misconduct and an enquiry in terms of company procedures.</p>
<p>The firm said the decision had been taken in conjunction with the government and Ndhlela was suspended on full pay.</p>
<p>The company declined to make further comment.</p>
